<view class="page"><image class="page-backdrop" src="cloud://cloud1-d7gketoi570d17f80.636c-cloud1-d7gketoi570d17f80-1524135194/media-v1/assets__spring-lake.webp" mode="aspectFill" aria-hidden="true"/><view class="title">本洞补充记录</view><view class="sub">第 {{hole}} 洞 · {{player}}</view><view class="muted">比赛事件仅影响选中的比赛范围，不补写实际总杆。奖项由记分员确认。</view><view class="card" wx:for="{{fields}}" wx:key="key"><view class="muted">{{item.label}}</view><picker class="choice-picker choice-inset" data-title="{{item.label}}" wx:if="{{item.type==='select'}}" range="{{item.options}}" range-key="label" value="{{item.index}}" data-index="{{index}}" disabled="{{!item.options.length}}" bindchange="change"><view class="select-field {{!item.options.length?'select-disabled':''}}"><view class="select-copy"><view class="select-value">{{item.options.length?item.options[item.index].label:'本洞无适用项目'}}</view></view><image class="select-chevron" src="/assets/chevron.png" aria-hidden="true"/></view></picker><switch wx:elif="{{item.type==='boolean'}}" checked="{{item.value}}" data-index="{{index}}" bindchange="change"/><input wx:elif="{{item.type==='number'}}" type="number" value="{{item.value}}" data-index="{{index}}" bindinput="change"/><textarea wx:else value="{{item.value}}" data-index="{{index}}" bindinput="change" auto-height/></view><checkbox-group wx:if="{{mode==='award'}}" bindchange="winners"><view class="section">获奖者（并列可多选）</view><label wx:for="{{players}}" wx:key="id" class="card row"><checkbox value="{{item.id}}"/><text>{{item.name}}</text></label></checkbox-group><button class="primary space" bindtap="save">核对并确认保存</button></view>

